- removed some redundant processes to improve performance.
- removed APECS code as that experiment has run its course.
- created added showJournal(journalName) to the system to centralise this 
function. It fetches JournalEntries from a memory storage where they have been 
gathered from various compendia.
- added slugify(text) to the system to centralise this function. It removes 
spaces, hyphens and unprintable characters then converts the whole thing to 
lower case, allowing the result to be used in the code as a valid reference. 
The function was there already, but distributed.

